Language English
Debug Off

Book SarahRitualWarnings Ordered No Keep
	Triggered By @Sarah If ritual and Not firstRitualDone
	
	Page Dvm
		Visible If Not dvmFinished
		
		Text """
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<You must finish reading the
			{c:QItemDvm}. You cannot understand what is happening without
			reading it.>>
		"""
	End Page Dvm
	
	Page JournalNoHole
		Visible If Not journalFinished And Not foundHoleInWall
		
		Text """
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<You must finish reading the journal.
			Surely it will tell in more about what is happening now. We still
			don't know how to find the altar and we aren't sure what your role
			is to be. We must hurry.>>
		"""
	End Page JournalNoHole
	
	Page Journal
		Visible If Not journalfinished and foundHoleInWall
		
		Text """
			You must finish reading the journal. Surely it will tell in more
			detail what is happening now. We don't even know what their plans
			are for you and your friends.>>
		"""
	End Page Journal
	
	Page ElderSign
		Visible If Not foundElderSign
		
		Text """
			I feel like we are still missing something. Something important,
			though I'm not sure what it is. We should look around. Maybe we'll
			find what I'm feeling.>>
		"""
	End Page ElderSign
End Book SarahRitualWarnings